  "bodyHash": "5VQiY+Nz3a8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RTB4jwR.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/RTB4jwR.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"282\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/maqwPXV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/maqwPXV.png\" width=\"346\" height=\"251\"></p><p><strong>重骰屬性：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5nfaadN.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/5nfaadN.png\" width=\"541\" height=\"359\"></p><p><strong>升級屬性：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ghJFcn2.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/ghJFcn2.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"380\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DNaL7vN.gif\" alt=\"範例\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/spoorn/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=其他專案&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=other projects&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"175\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://tinyurl.com/spoorndiscordbadge\" alt=\"https://tinyurl.com/spoorndiscordbadge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=問題回報 &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=issues &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>模組說明</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為所有護甲物品（原版與模組新增）添加隨機化護甲屬性，例如額外最大生命值、移動速度、傷害減免、擊退抗性、荊棘反傷等，透過加成傷害、屬性和/或效果來強化護甲物品。每個屬性都有各自在護甲物品上生成的機率，並可混合搭配。只要護甲物品延伸自原版護甲系統，這些屬性即可生成於任何護甲上</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：當護甲物品加入玩家物品欄時，每個屬性都有機率被附加。若屬性生效，則會隨機生成其他數值——例如額外最大生命值。每個屬性生效的預設機率較低，以避免護甲過於強勢（例如額外最大生命值機率為5%）。請參閱下方「設定」章節了解如何調整這些機率或其他配置</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spoorn-weapon-attributes\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spoorn-weapon-attributes</a>&nbsp;搭配效果極佳</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>功能特色</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">功能大致不言自明，但此處仍提供摘要：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>最大生命值：</strong>&nbsp;為玩家增加額外最大生命值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>傷害減免</strong>：按百分比減免玩家<strong>最終</strong>承受的傷害。所有護甲物品的減傷效果以指數方式疊加</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>移動速度</strong>：根據基礎移動速度為玩家增加百分比移動速度。所有護甲物品的加速效果以線性方式疊加</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>擊退抗性</strong>：原版擊退抗性機制。被攻擊時有機率不被<strong>水平</strong>擊退</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>荊棘</strong>：將一定百分比傷害返還給攻擊者。所有護甲物品的反傷效果以線性方式疊加</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過在鐵砧中放置護甲+青金石來<strong>重骰</strong>護甲屬性（重骰所需物品與等級消耗可配置）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過在鐵砧中放置護甲+鑽石來<strong>升級</strong>護甲屬性（升級所需物品與等級消耗可配置）。升級將重新擲骰屬性，並應用<strong>優於</strong>先前的新屬性！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">減速/燃燒/中毒等各種效果的持續時間可根據屬性擲骰的傷害值調整。詳見設定檔案</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>設定配置</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可配置本模組各項設定，例如各武器屬性出現機率、屬性加成傷害等。設定檔案位於&nbsp;<code>config/spoornarmorattributes.json5</code></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">設定結構說明文件位於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornArmorAttributes/blob/main/config-documentation.json5\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/spoorn/spoornarmorattributes/blob/main/config-documentation.json5</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>依賴項目</strong></h3><p>本模組需要：</p><ul>\n<li>Cloth Config API - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config</a></li>\n<li>Fabric API - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>伺服器端必須安裝本模組才能使屬性生效，客戶端需安裝才能顯示屬性提示文字。若僅安裝於伺服器端，屬性仍會生效，但客戶端將看不到提示文字更新。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HabVZJR.png\" alt=\"需要Fabric\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></p><h2>需要伺服器？</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fspoorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KPURPK0.png\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn\" width=\"1000\" height=\"158\"></a></p>",
